---
// Architecture - Schéma d'architecture de style terminal
---

<section class="relative py-20 bg-[#111111]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20 flex flex-col items-center">
    <span class="block text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-[2px] text-accent mb-6">ARCHITECTURE</span>
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-[32px] font-bold text-white mb-10 text-center">Comment tout est connecté</h2>
    
    <div class="w-full max-w-[1000px] rounded-xl border border-[#00FF4130] overflow-hidden bg-[#0D1117]">
      <!-- En-tête du terminal -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 h-9 bg-[#252525]">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#EF4444]"></span>
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#F59E0B]"></span>
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#22C55E]"></span>
        <span class="ml-2 text-[#64748B] font-mono text-[11px]">agentputer@cloud:~ — aperçu de l'architecture</span>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Schéma d'architecture -->
      <div class="p-6 overflow-x-auto">
        <pre class="font-mono text-xs md:text-[13px] leading-[1.8]"><span class="text-[#00BFFF]">$ agentputer architecture --verbose</span>

<span class="text-[#FFD700]">  ╔═══ COUCHE D'ACCÈS UTILISATEUR ═══════════════════════════╗</span>
<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  ║  Telegram │ WhatsApp │ Discord │ Web │ API │ Voix       ║</span>
<span class="text-[#FFD700]">  ╚══════════════════════════╤════════════════════════════╝</span>
<span class="text-[#333333]">                             │</span>
<span class="text-[#A855F7]">  ╔═══ COUCHE D'ORCHESTRATION ╧══════════════════════════╗</span>
<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  ║  🔒 Privacy Proxy │ 🧠 Contexte │ 📋 Journal d'audit ║</span>
<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  ║  Planificateur → Décomposeur d'étapes → Répartiteur   ║</span>
<span class="text-[#A855F7]">  ╚══════════════════════════╤════════════════════════════╝</span>
<span class="text-[#333333]">                             │</span>
<span class="text-accent">  ╔═══ COUCHE D'EXÉCUTION ════╧══════════════════════════╗</span>
<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  ║  📄 Docs │ 📧 E-mail │ 🌐 Web │ 💻 Code │ 📁 Fichiers ║</span>
<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  ║  🔌 Interface Unifiée → Place de marché des Skills    ║</span>
<span class="text-accent">  ╚══════════════════════════╤════════════════════════════╝</span>
<span class="text-[#333333]">                             │</span>
<span class="text-[#00BFFF]">  ╔═══ COUCHE DE PERSISTANCE ═╧══════════════════════════╗</span>
<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  ║  💾 Système de fichiers │ 🗄️ BDD d'état │ 🔍 Banque vect. ║</span>
<span class="text-[#94A3B8]">  ║  Tout est chiffré (AES-256) │ Priorité au local      ║</span>
<span class="text-[#00BFFF]">  ╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝</span></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>